<title>SRI LANKA: Samuel suspended following Canadian offer.</title>
<headline>Samuel suspended following Canadian offer.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Samuel, Sons &amp; Co Ltd was suspended for one day following an offer from Cretnor Canada Inc to invest in the company's equity capital, the Colombo Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We will be imposing a trading halt in Samuel, Sons &amp; Co Ltd on Monday to disseminate the details of an offer received ... from Cretnor Canada Inc to invest in the equity capital of the company,&quot; the release said.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on January 15. January 14 is a national holiday.</p>
</text>
